  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate change has dramatically contracted the amount of food smallholders farmers in Bong county are able to produce, with very negative cinsequences for food security. The project will establish Women&#x2019;s Resource Centers as seed bank, set-up village savings and loan associations, and provide training in climate-smart agriculture and financial management. The project addresses climate vulnerability and gender inequality faced by rural women farmers.</narrative>
  </description>
